{
  "fragments": [
    {
      "file": "voice-01.m4a",
      "duration": 9.25,
      "kind": "signature",
      "source": "the-catch",
      "text": "He's given time. He wants Jefferson. Climbs the ladder. Oh my goodness! Justin!"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice-02.m4a",
      "duration": 8.85,
      "kind": "signature",
      "source": "the-peach-bowl",
      "text": "The slant, the catch, and the touchdown for Justin Jefferson. Touchdown pass to Jefferson."
    },
    {
      "file": "voice-03.m4a",
      "duration": 8.5,
      "kind": "signature",
      "source": "offensive-player-of-the-year",
      "text": "Now, check out these game-defining players, the finalists for NFL Offensive Player of the Year."
    },
    {
      "file": "voice-04.m4a",
      "duration": 7.85,
      "kind": "signature",
      "source": "the-rookie-record",
      "text": "He's got a wide open Justin Jefferson, and there is your new single-season..."
    },
    {
      "file": "voice-05.m4a",
      "duration": 6.6,
      "kind": "signature",
      "source": "pro-bowl-selection",
      "text": "We need that money. We need that bread, man. We need that bread, dawg."
    },
    {
      "file": "voice-06.m4a",
      "duration": 7.9,
      "kind": "signature",
      "source": "the-catch",
      "text": "Two minutes left in a four-point game. Kirk Cousins back to throw on fourth and eight."
    },
    {
      "file": "voice-07.m4a",
      "duration": 8.6,
      "kind": "signature",
      "source": "the-peach-bowl",
      "text": "Burrow dodges the rush. Going for Jefferson again. It's another touchdown."
    },
    {
      "file": "voice-08.m4a",
      "duration": 7.4,
      "kind": "signature",
      "source": "offensive-player-of-the-year",
      "text": "Justin Jefferson, one bad man. Dive for the end zone, touchdown!"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice-09.m4a",
      "duration": 7.75,
      "kind": "signature",
      "source": "the-rookie-record",
      "text": "Minnesota Viking receiving yard record holder, passing the great Randy Moss."
    },
    {
      "file": "voice-10.m4a",
      "duration": 6.75,
      "kind": "signature",
      "source": "pro-bowl-selection",
      "text": "Look at it, the entire NFC team has left the bench."
    },
    {
      "file": "voice-11.m4a",
      "duration": 6.6,
      "kind": "signature",
      "source": "the-peach-bowl",
      "text": "Watch the little hesitation by Jefferson. Just a little freeze."
    },
    {
      "file": "voice-12.m4a",
      "duration": 7.65,
      "kind": "signature",
      "source": "offensive-player-of-the-year",
      "text": "And the 2022 AP Offensive Player of the Year is..."
    },
    {
      "file": "voice-13.m4a",
      "duration": 5.95,
      "kind": "signature",
      "source": "the-catch",
      "text": "That has been replaced by Justin Jefferson's catch."
    },
    {
      "file": "voice-14.m4a",
      "duration": 5.6,
      "kind": "signature",
      "source": "offensive-player-of-the-year",
      "text": "Justin Jefferson."
    },
    {
      "file": "voice-15.m4a",
      "duration": 8.62,
      "kind": "signature",
      "source": "the-rookie-record",
      "text": "Justin Jefferson eats space. He chews up the corner, the space between the wide receiver..."
    },
    {
      "file": "voice-16.m4a",
      "duration": 6.3,
      "kind": "signature",
      "source": "the-peach-bowl",
      "text": "Another touchdown. Jefferson hangs on this time."
    },
    {
      "file": "voice-17.m4a",
      "duration": 7.4,
      "kind": "signature",
      "source": "pro-bowl-selection",
      "text": "We're going blue 11, this is a double pass. Gonna run a wide route and then throw it, okay?"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice-18.m4a",
      "duration": 8.1,
      "kind": "signature",
      "source": "offensive-player-of-the-year",
      "text": "First and foremost, I got to thank the man upstairs. Without him, none of this would be possible."
    },
